WEBVTT

00:02:54.795 --> 00:03:00.551
It's a continuum of petrochemical
and plastics manufacturing facilities

00:03:00.593 --> 00:03:03.429
on acres of former plantations.

00:03:03.888 --> 00:03:06.098
Now, these facilities have created

00:03:06.140 --> 00:03:10.269
an intergenerational history
of death from cancer,

00:03:10.269 --> 00:03:13.397
with some communities
suffering cancer rates

00:03:13.439 --> 00:03:15.608
higher than the national rate.

00:03:17.068 --> 00:03:20.112
Now communities experience
environmental hazards

00:03:20.112 --> 00:03:22.949
and pollution exposure in diverse ways.

00:03:22.949 --> 00:03:24.200
In urban areas,

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:28.246
mobile sources, contaminated sites,
they're really the challenge.

00:03:28.287 --> 00:03:33.793
And local governments generally manage
the infrastructure of pollution.